            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Thang Long",
            "review_text": "Jacqueline T\nSydney, Australia2 contributions\n0\nexcellent place to eat\nNov 2017 • Couples\nWe have a very delicious meal at this very cute restaurant. The BunCha specialty is a must have as are the spring rolls (best I have ever eaten) and the fruit salad fritter. Run by a nice family.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 23, 2017",
