            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Thang Long",
            "review_text": "JamonaJava\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam71 contributions\n0\nOne of best Bun Cha in HCM - close to Hanoi quality\nOct 2017 • Friends\nBun Cha is great Vietnamese food, easy to get addicted. It is a Hanoi dish, difficult to find a good one in HCM, as is the case of Pho noodle. Very fortunately, this nice local restaurant offers perhaps one of the best bun cha in town. It is pretty close to Hanoi quality. I came and ate more than 10 times.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 21, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
